---
title: Figure 2.6 — Sequence, quiz submission through mastery and SM-2
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor L as Learner
    participant UI as QuizCard.jsx
    participant R as quiz_router
    participant QS as QuizService
    participant PS as ProgressService
    participant KG as KnowledgeGraphService
    participant SR as SpacedRepetitionService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    L->>UI: selects an option
    UI->>R: POST /quiz/submit {quiz_id, selected_option}
    R->>QS: submit_answer(quiz_id, user_id, option)

    rect rgb(254, 242, 242)
        note over QS,DB: A quiz is answerable only by the<br/>owner of the session holding it
        QS->>DB: SELECT quiz
        QS->>DB: SELECT session WHERE id=? AND user_id=?
        DB-->>QS: session, or nothing → 404
    end

    QS->>QS: is_correct = (option == correct_option)<br/>points = quiz.points if correct else 0
    QS->>DB: INSERT quiz_attempt

    QS->>PS: update_progress(topic, points, is_correct)
    PS->>DB: UPDATE topic_progress
    PS->>PS: level from cumulative points<br/>(50 → INTERMEDIATE, 150 → ADVANCED)
    PS-->>QS: progress
    QS->>DB: sync session.current_level

    alt session is pinned to a concept
        QS->>KG: update_mastery_after_quiz(concept, is_correct)
        KG->>DB: SELECT concept_mastery
        KG->>KG: accuracy = correct / total
        KG->>KG: mastery = 0.7·accuracy + 0.3·previous
        note right of KG: Blended rather than replaced, so one<br/>unlucky answer can't erase a history<br/>of correct ones
        KG->>KG: confidence = min(1, interactions / 10)
        KG->>DB: UPDATE concept_mastery
        KG-->>QS: mastery row

        QS->>SR: update_after_review(mastery, is_correct)
        SR->>SR: quality = 5 if correct and mastery ≥ 0.7<br/>else 4 if correct, else 1
        SR->>SR: EF += 0.1 − (5−q)(0.08 + 0.02(5−q)),<br/>floored at 1.3

        alt quality < 3 (incorrect)
            SR->>SR: interval = 1 day
            note right of SR: Reset, not decremented —<br/>a missed concept comes back tomorrow
        else first success
            SR->>SR: interval 1 → 6 days
        else subsequent success
            SR->>SR: interval ×= ease factor
        end

        SR->>DB: UPDATE next_review_at = now + interval
        SR-->>QS: rescheduled
    else free-form topic
        note over QS: Points still accrue, but no concept<br/>mastery and no review scheduling
    end

    QS->>DB: INSERT engagement event
    QS-->>R: {correct, correct_option, points,<br/>explanation, hint if wrong, new_level}
    R-->>UI: result
    UI-->>L: green or red option, explanation,<br/>and a "Next question" prompt
